<title>BRAZIL: Brazil April 11 coffee regs 2.66 mln bags to June.</title>
<headline>Brazil April 11 coffee regs 2.66 mln bags to June.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of April 11 totalled 2.66 million bags for April, May and June, according to the April 17 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> April		  1,637,919</p>
<p> May			922,324</p>
<p> June			99,520</p>
<p> TOTAL		  2,659,763</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
